{"v":1,"id":"f195368391ce","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"I look around at this world you created","s":20.54,"e":26.6},{"t":"At all the beautiful things I see","s":26.6,"e":34.94},{"t":"And I know that you made it","s":37.26,"e":42.12},{"t":"You made it all for me","s":42.12,"e":49.84},{"t":"Oh, I thank you, Lord","s":52.7,"e":57.44},{"t":"For all you've done","s":58.16,"e":60.56},{"t":"For everything","s":61.56,"e":63.38},{"t":"Under the sun","s":64.9,"e":67.74},{"t":"Cause I know you made it all for love","s":68.66,"e":74.66},{"t":"Every blessing from above","s":75.34,"e":78.3},{"t":"All that I see, so I say","s":78.3,"e":82.0},{"t":"Thank you, Lord, every day","s":82.0,"e":89.02},{"t":"Mountains high and oceans wide","s":101.98,"e":105.88},{"t":"Every sunset, every time","s":109.46,"e":113.08},{"t":"Gentle breezes, skies so blue","s":116.14,"e":119.98},{"t":"All remind me of your truth","s":123.18,"e":127.08},{"t":"In the beauty I find peace","s":130.66,"e":134.3},{"t":"Your creation never ceases","s":137.92,"e":142.88},{"t":"In my heart, my love for you thrives","s":145.66,"e":150.4},{"t":"Thank you, Lord, for making it all","s":151.58,"e":154.58},{"t":"Thank you for the beauty you put in our lives","s":154.58,"e":159.02},{"t":"Oh, I thank you, Lord","s":159.02,"e":163.28},{"t":"Forever you've done","s":163.28,"e":166.52},{"t":"For everything","s":167.3,"e":169.26},{"t":"Under the sun","s":170.98,"e":173.62},{"t":"Cause I know you made it all for love","s":175.02,"e":180.52},{"t":"Every blessing from above","s":181.08,"e":184.16},{"t":"All that I see, so I say","s":184.74,"e":187.92},{"t":"Thank you, Lord","s":189.36,"e":191.66},{"t":"Lord, every day","s":192.94,"e":194.92},{"t":"I thank you","s":202.28,"e":204.72},{"t":"For every sin, for all that you made","s":207.96,"e":212.66},{"t":"Every moment, every breath, your love speaks","s":212.66,"e":216.94},{"t":"Thank you, Lord, endlessly","s":216.94,"e":221.22},{"t":"Oh, thank you, Lord","s":227.74,"e":230.76}],"match":null}
